Z||000000||theogre||05-27-99||11:58 AM||||Here's a site with more AC data than even an Ogre can inhale.  <A HREF="http://www.aircondition.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.aircondition.com/</A> <p>there is even a link to a site where you can take the EPA 609 test for $20us. This certification allows you to buy R12 in the U.S.
